ar, January 2024\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <span class=\"video-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"video-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"video-card-title\">How to Operationalize MMM for Tech Companies</span>\n          <span class=\"video-card-date\">Webinar · 30 Jan 2024</span>\n        </div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"video-card\" type=\"button\" data-embed=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M1nz3hhD0xM?autoplay=1&amp;start=3109\" data-caption=\"MMM Hub Webinar with Jim Gianoglio & Michael Kaminsky. Virtual Webinar, 28 February 2024. Panel discussion on Marketing Mix Modeling with industry experts.\">\n        <div class=\"video-thumb\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/M1nz3hhD0xM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"MMM Hub Webinar with Gianoglio and Kaminsky — February 2024\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <span class=\"video-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"video-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"video-card-title\">MMM Hub Webinar with Gianoglio & Kaminsky</span>\n          <span class=\"video-card-date\">Webinar · 28 Feb 2024</span>\n         </div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"video-card\" type=\"button\" data-embed=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IvXfE0C0NxE?autoplay=1\" data-caption=\"Graphical Models &amp; Multi-Objective Budget Optimization for Causal Mix Models.\">\n        <div class=\"video-thumb\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/IvXfE0C0NxE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Graphical Models and Multi-Objective Budget Optimization for Causal Mix Models\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <span class=\"video-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"video-card-body\">\n          <span class=\"video-card-title\">Graphical Models &amp; Multi-Objective Budget Optimization</span>\n          <span class=\"video-card-date\">2026</span>\n        </div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"video-card\" typ